<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NASA - IIT Bombay | Support Us & Bylaws</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        
        body {
            background-color: #f5f7fa;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Top Header Navigation */
        .top-banner {
            background-color: #000046;
            padding: 15px 50px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 4px solid #ffcccc;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .top-banner img.logo-left,
        .top-banner img.logo-right {
            height: 80px;
            background: white;
            padding: 5px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .nav-menu {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            list-style: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .nav-menu li {
            margin: 0 8px;
        }

        .nav-menu li a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #800020;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-menu li a:hover,
        .nav-menu li a.active {
            background-color: #800020;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        .welcome-bar {
            background-color: #800020;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Main Container */
        .main-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .doc-header {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 5px solid #1e3a8a;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .doc-header h2 {
            color: #1e3a8a;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .doc-header h3 {
            color: #800020;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 18px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-left: 5px solid #800020;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #1e3a8a;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .card p {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .pillars-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .pillar-item {
            background: #f8fafc;
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border-top: 3px solid #1e3a8a;
        }

        .pillar-item h4 {
            color: #800020;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .vision-mission {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .top-banner {
                justify-content: center;
                padding: 15px 20px;
            }
            .vision-mission {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #111827;
            color: #9ca3af;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        footer p {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header class="top-banner">
        <img class="logo-left" src="img/IITBLOGO.JPG" alt="IIT Bombay Logo">
        
        <ul class="nav-menu">
            <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="members.html">Members</a></li>
            <li><a href="events.html">Events</a></li>
            <li><a href="gallery.html">Gallery</a></li>
            <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>

        </ul>

        <img class="logo-right" src="img/NASA-LOGO.JPG" alt="NASA Logo">
    </header>

    <div class="welcome-bar">
        Welcome to NASA (NON-ACADEMIC STAFF ASSOCIATION) - IIT Bombay
    </div>

    <main class="main-container">
        <div class="doc-header">
            <h2>NON-ACADEMIC STAFF ASSOCIATION (NASA) — IIT BOMBAY</h2>
            <p>(Registered under Societies Act, 1860, Regn. No. Bom.F4227)</p>
            <p>(Recognized by the Board of Governors, IIT Bombay)</p>
            <h3>RULES AND BYLAWS (REVISED 2022)</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>1. Name & Registered Office</h3>
            <p><strong>1.</strong> The name of the Society shall be "Non-Academic Staff Association, IIT Bombay."</p>
            <p><strong>2.</strong> The term "Association" hereinafter shall refer to the Non-Academic Staff Association, IIT Bombay.</p>
            <p><strong>Registered Office:</strong> Ground Floor, Main Building, IIT Bombay, Powai, Mumbai – 400076</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>3. Aims and Objectives</h3>
            <p><strong>3.1</strong> To help promote the professional advancement of members and improve their service conditions and work opportunities, in harmony with the development of the Institute.</p>
            <p><strong>3.2</strong> To protect the present and future interests and prospects of the members and to work for their welfare.</p>
            <p><strong>3.3</strong> To maintain a cooperative, progressive, and creative attitude, and to promote collective thinking in addressing the problems of the members and of the Institute in general.</p>
            <p><strong>3.4</strong> To strive to help in addressing crises and exigencies arising at the national level by pooling the cooperation of the members.</p>
            <p><strong>3.5</strong> To cooperate with and affiliate to like-minded associations and organizations of a non-political nature.</p>
            <p><strong>3.6</strong> To carry out such other activities as may be deemed necessary for the furtherance of the aims and objectives of the Association.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>NASA Objectives & Goals (Pillars of Purpose)</h3>
            <div class="pillars-grid">
                <div class="pillar-item">
                    <h4>1. The Pillar of Well-being</h4>
                    <p>We commit to creating an environment where every staff member feels healthy, safe, and supported — through wellness initiatives and caring programs.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar-item">
                    <h4>2. The Pillar of Togetherness</h4>
                    <p>We bring people closer. By hosting cultural festivals, open forums, and recreational activities, we strengthen the bonds of our vibrant community.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar-item">
                    <h4>3. The Pillar of Voice & Visibility</h4>
                    <p>Your voice matters. NASA is a platform where every idea, concern, and aspiration find space, respect, and response.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar-item">
                    <h4>4. The Pillar of Recognition</h4>
                    <p>Celebrating every achievement, big or small — we honour the contributions of our staff, boosting morale and spreading positivity.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar-item">
                    <h4>5. The Pillar of Growth</h4>
                    <p>We open doors to learning and skill-building opportunities, empowering staff members to grow both personally and professionally.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar-item">
                    <h4>6. The Pillar of Unity & Inclusivity</h4>
                    <p>Together, we rise. We build a culture of equality and unity, making sure that every member feels they belong to the NASA family.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vision-mission">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Vision of NASA</h3>
                <p>To nurture a strong sense of belonging and unity among the staff members of IIT Bombay by promoting well-being, mutual respect, and active participation in community life.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Mission of NASA</h3>
                <p>To build an inclusive, supportive, and vibrant community where every staff member feels valued, connected, and motivated to contribute towards the shared progress of IIT Bombay, while nurturing a positive and collaborative environment.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; Non-Academic Staff Association (NASA), IIT Bombay. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        <p>Ground Floor, Main Building, IIT Bombay, Powai, Mumbai – 400076</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>